readsb (3.16.15-2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild on Debian trixie: the 3.16.15-1 debs were built on Ubuntu
    runners and depended on librtlsdr2, which does not exist on Debian
    (librtlsdr0 there) — uninstallable on AryaOS/trixie.

